From 8f4a2c1e6b9d3570a1c2e5f8b0d4a7c3e6f9b2d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ohos: link KF6::KIOCore instead of KF6::KIOWidgets

The published kio/6.26.0 package on ohpcd is a KIOCORE_ONLY baseline: it
ships libKF6KIOCore plus the kioworker/ktrash6/file/remote/trash workers,
but not KF6KIOWidgets (that library needs kbookmarks/solid/kjobwidgets/
kiconthemes 6.26, several of which are not published on ohpcd).

kdialog uses exactly one KIO symbol: KRecentDocument::add() in the
--getsavefilename branch (src/kdialog.cpp), and KRecentDocument is
exported by KIOCore (kio src/core/krecentdocument.cpp, class
KIOCORE_EXPORT KRecentDocument). Relinking the target against KF6::KIOCore
keeps the recent-documents feature intact without pulling in the
unpublished KIOWidgets library. The other "KIO-looking" call site,
KColorMimeData::fromMimeData() in the --getcolor branch, belongs to
KGuiAddons (not KIO) and is unaffected.

No platform macros: this is a pure link-target swap (R8 compliant).
---
 src/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/CMakeLists.txt b/src/CMakeLists.txt
index 6b3e57a..9f5e2c8 100644
--- a/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -20,5 +20,5 @@
 target_link_libraries(kdialog
-    KF6::KIOWidgets
+    KF6::KIOCore
     KF6::TextWidgets
     KF6::Notifications
     KF6::IconThemes
